{"t": 1794105037.1667304, "kind": "call", "tool": "gitlab_create_merge_request_thread", "args": {"body": "Pipeline fix for main (pipeline #8812, job test:contract #77104).\n\n**Root cause**\n`contract/test_invoice.py::test_invoice_number_format` asserts the ERP v2 format `INV-2026-000042` (sequence zero-padded to 6 digits, per FIN-77), but `billing/invoice.py` still emitted the unpadded sequence:\n\n    AssertionError: assert 'INV-2026-42' == 'INV-2026-000042'\n\nThe contract test already encodes the ERP v2 spec, so the implementation was the stale side.\n\n**Fix**\nIn `billing/invoice.py`, format the sequence with a 6-digit zero-padded field:\n\n    return f\"INV-{year}-{seq:06d}\"\n\n**Verification**\nRan the contract test locally against the patched module: `1 passed`. The `lint` job is unaffected. No test/contract changes were made - the contract stays as the source of truth for the ERP import format.", "merge_request_iid": "12", "project_id": "acme/billing-legacy"}, "ok": true}
